


>> CoffeeMachine := વસ્તુ નવું.
CoffeeMachine જ્યારે: ['order:'] કરો: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) સાચું-હોય-તો: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) સાચું-હોય-તો: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) સાચું-હોય-તો: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := વસ્તુ નવું.
SimpleCoffeeMachine જ્યારે: ['order'] કરો: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
આઉટપુટ લખો: redCup, નવી-લીટી.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
આઉટપુટ લખો: greenCup, નવી-લીટી.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
આઉટપુટ લખો: yellowCup, નવી-લીટી.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
આઉટપુટ લખો: blueCup, નવી-લીટી.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
આઉટપુટ લખો: blackCup, નવી-લીટી.
blackCup અંતે-ઉમેરો: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
આઉટપુટ લખો: orangeCup, નવી-લીટી.
